flowchart LR
    X[Input tokens] --> L
    subgraph L[One layer during QLoRA training]
      W[Frozen base weights<br/>stored in 4-bit NF4] --> DQ[Dequantise to 16-bit<br/>on the fly]
      AD[LoRA adapter A, B<br/>16-bit, trainable]
      DQ --> SUM((+))
      AD --> SUM
    end
    SUM --> Y[Output]
    Y -. gradients flow only to .-> AD
